ion was observed, and node1 returned with a different boot identity, a running system, active and enabled crond, the opsadmin account, and the effective policy intact. Fixed lifecycle boot identities independently agree with the executor evidence.","limitations":["Denial behavior was sampled directly with the unlisted nobody account rather than every possible unlisted account; the exact two-entry cron.allow file supplies the broader policy evidence. No contradiction was observed."]}
